    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive in a post-apocalyptic world</h2></strong><strong>Breathe if you can...</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/e578effb1c2ae287cfc4889a45c2d390.poster.avif?t=1745363467\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/e578effb1c2ae287cfc4889a45c2d390.webm?t=1745363467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/e578effb1c2ae287cfc4889a45c2d390.mp4?t=1745363467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/2b0ce0d3dce84585a9eb65ca772fbc74.webp?t=1745363467\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/7584cd6912abaa8129a32fb449b5005d.poster.avif?t=1745363467\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/7584cd6912abaa8129a32fb449b5005d.webm?t=1745363467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/7584cd6912abaa8129a32fb449b5005d.mp4?t=1745363467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/2b0ce0d3dce84585a9eb65ca772fbc74.webp?t=1745363467\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/e94a40c531e033522beb39d0f4f7f6fa.poster.avif?t=1745363467\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/e94a40c531e033522beb39d0f4f7f6fa.webm?t=1745363467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/e94a40c531e033522beb39d0f4f7f6fa.mp4?t=1745363467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2694\ufe0f Fight against bandits, cultists, military, psychos, and animals.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Explore the open world and uncover its mysteries.<br>\ud83d\udd0d Find a home that will become your shelter and arrange it.<br>\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f Survive by gathering resources and provisions.<br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Craft weapons, resources, medicines, and supplies.<br>\ud83c\udfaf Hunt diverse wildlife.<br><br>A vast world awaits you, ripe for exploration not just for air, but also for other vital resources: food, water, weapons, and armor. Players can follow different narrative paths, from mere survival to interacting with bandits and uncovering the secrets of this devastated world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/e20b32cc0bac8f3f1c36172a3e45591f.avif?t=1745363467\" /></span><br><br>Survival is the cornerstone of the gameplay. Players need to adapt to harsh conditions, securing food, water, and shelter while crafting weapons and armor to protect against wild animals, bandits, and other unknown threats.<br><br>Danger lurks at every corner in this world. Lack of air, radioactive zones, aggressive creatures, and hostile groups can all lead to your demise. Beyond physical threats, players encounter moral dilemmas that can alter the course of the story and the outcome of their survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/c43dca20014a101d565b5f5d892e1942.avif?t=1745363467\" /></span><br><br>In &quot;HOLD YOUR BREATH,&quot; players are continually faced with the choice between risk and potential reward. Is it worth venturing into danger for valuable resources? Should you trust strangers? Each decision you make could have long-term implications.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360550/extras/700e32b2bfe2afd412edeabdd6bc958b.avif?t=1745363467\" /></span><br><br>Dive into the world of &quot;HOLD YOUR BREATH&quot; if you're ready to confront a reality where every breath could be your last. The choice is yours: fight for every liter of air or succumb and become yet another victim of this ruthless world.",
